                <p>Leland Harrison, Diplomatic Secretary of the American Commission to Negotiate
                    Peace; Herman C. Norman, Secretary of the British delegation; and Sadao Saburi,
                    Secretary of the Japanese delegation.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
